Subject: [PATCH] DV GL: native output hooks in the GL video renderer

Port the GLES video renderer's DV hooks to the GL one: source and
enhancement-layer retention per buffer, the bridge layer and render
path, frame receipts, scaling selection and HDR10 AI lookahead.

